<title>SWEDEN: Riksbank to use straight repos rather than reverse.</title>
<headline>Riksbank to use straight repos rather than reverse.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank, the Riksbank, said on Tuesday that it is to change its interest rate control system to straight repos from reverse repos from April 15.</p>
<p>In future the Riksbank will be arranging repos so as to supply liquidity to the banking system, the bank said.</p>
</text>
